insert into public.stories (id, owner_id, visibility, status, draft_title, draft_body, draft_summary, language, grade_level, topic, revision)
values ($seed$00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102$seed$, null, 'library', 'published', $seed$Rain on the Roof$seed$, $seed$Tap, tap, tap. The rain is on the roof. Ana looks out the window. The street is shiny and wet.

Ana puts on her yellow raincoat and her boots. She and her father walk to the store. They jump over the small puddles.

At home, Ana drinks warm chocolate. She listens to the rain. Tap, tap, tap. It sounds like a song.$seed$, $seed$Ana listens to the rain and takes a walk.$seed$, $seed$en$seed$, 1, $seed$Weather$seed$, 1)
